<%# Shared by both places the Billing page shows this month's already-
    accrued overage charges: nested inside the "Overage billing" card for
    an org still on a capped plan, and in its own small card for an org
    that upgraded to an unlimited plan mid-month but still owes overage
    charges from before the upgrade -- see index.html.erb. %>
<% overage_cents = @overages_this_month.sum(:amount_cents) %>
<div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-paper px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">
  <span class="font-medium text-ink"><%= pluralize(@overages_this_month.count, "extra packet") %></span>
  this month —
  <span class="mono"><%= number_to_currency(overage_cents / 100.0) %></span>
  will be added to your next invoice.
</div>
